---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { photo } from '../../data/travel';
---
<PageLayout title="Our story | Wanderwell" description="Meet the people and the travel philosophy behind Wanderwell.">
	<main class="inner-page">
		<section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-image" style={`background-image:url('${photo('photo-1470770841072-f978cf4d019e', 1800)}')`}></div><div class="page-hero-content"><span class="page-eyebrow">A SMALL TEAM WITH A BIG MAP</span><h1>Travel closer<br /><em>to the feeling.</em></h1><p>We make thoughtful journeys for curious people who want to meet a place, not just pass through it.</p></div></section>
		<section class="editorial-split"><div class="editorial-image" style={`background-image:url('${photo('photo-1511988617509-a57c8a288659', 1200)}')`}></div><div class="editorial-copy"><span class="eyebrow">WHY WE WANDER</span><h2>Travel can make the world feel a little smaller.</h2><p>Wanderwell began with a simple idea: the best trips are shaped by people who call a place home. We bring local knowledge and thoughtful planning together, then leave enough space for the unplanned moments that make a journey yours.</p><p>We’re a small team of planners, guides, and lifelong travelers. Our work is personal because we believe your time away should feel that way too.</p><a class="story-link" href="/destinations/">Meet our journeys <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
		<section class="content-wrap"><div class="content-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHAT WE BELIEVE</span><h2>Good travel has a lighter touch.</h2></div></div><div class="value-grid"><article class="value-card"><span>01</span><h3>Local, always</h3><p>We work with independent guides, hosts, and makers who bring their home to life in a way no checklist can.</p></article><article class="value-card"><span>02</span><h3>Room to breathe</h3><p>We plan the important details and protect the open space in between. A day doesn’t need to be full to be memorable.</p></article><article class="value-card"><span>03</span><h3>Thoughtful by design</h3><p>We choose smaller stays, responsible local partners, and slower routes wherever we can.</p></article></div></section>
		<section class="editorial-split"><div class="editorial-copy"><span class="eyebrow">PEOPLE MAKE THE PLACE</span><h2>Meet your fellow wanderers.</h2><p>Our trip designers live for the little details: the right neighborhood, the guide who knows everyone, the lunch spot you’d never find on your own. Tell us what you love and we’ll find a way to weave it into the journey.</p><a class="primary-button" href="/contact/">Say hello <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="editorial-image" style={`background-image:url('${photo('photo-1529156069898-49953e39b3ac', 1200)}')`}></div></section>
		<section class="cta-band"><div><h2>Let’s make travel feel personal.</h2><p>Share what you’re dreaming about and we’ll take it from there.</p></div><a class="primary-button" href="/contact/">Talk with a trip designer <span>↗</span></a></section>
	</main>
</PageLayout>
